OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of M5 bridges is 'going
OL,4,Asmoothly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is "going smoothly" to remove two
OL,7,Fcrumbling footbridges over the M5.
OL,9,FThe motorway is closed in both
OL,10,Fdirections this weekend between
OL,11,Fjunctions 11 (Cheltenham) and 12
OL,12,F(Gloucester) and will not reopen until
OL,13,F06:00 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FTerry Robinson, from National Highways,
OL,16,Fsaid: "This has been months in planning
OL,17,Fand it is going really smoothly at the
OL,18,Fmoment, that is testament to the amount
OL,19,Fof planning which has gone into it."
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
