OL,3,GNEWSADemolition of M5 bridges is 'going
OL,4,Asmoothly'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut elsewhere, queues have built up
OL,7,Faround the edge of Gloucester as
OL,8,Fthousands of vehicles have been
OL,9,Fdiverted from the M5 between the two
OL,10,Fjunctions to allow the footbridges to
OL,11,Fbe removed.
